Acknowledgements
----------------

The Printer Application is built on PAPPL, the Printer Application Library,
by Michael R Sweet (https://www.msweet.org/pappl), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 with exceptions. PAPPL is not included in this source
repository. Binary distributions that link it include its copyright and
license notices.

Dave Coffin was the first to document the HBPL v1 print format publicly,
in his foo2hbpl1 driver (distributed with foo2zjs). This project contains no
code from foo2hbpl1 or foo2zjs. Its format specification (SPEC.md) was
written from observation of real print jobs, and the encoder, decoder and
tests were written from that specification alone.

The color conversion tables in app/color_tables.h were measured from the
printer manufacturer's original driver, by recording the printer color that
driver produced for each RGB input.

